<title>INDIA: Indian annualised interest rate on forward dollars.</title>
<headline>Indian annualised interest rate on forward dollars.</headline>
<dateline>BOMBAY 1996-09-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following are monthly annualised interest rates on forward dollar premia quoted by banks and brokers at 1600 IST. The rates are spot/one month to spot/six months.</p>
<p>	    O/N = -----				    O/N = 1.28%</p>
<p>	    T/N = 1.27%				    T/N = 1.28%</p>
<p>		   Sept 5, 1996			Sept 4, 1996</p>
<p>	  1 month forward =  6.80%	1 month forward =  5.45%</p>
<p>	  2 month forward =  8.50%	2 month forward =  7.49%</p>
<p>	  3 month forward =  9.29%	3 month forward =  8.28%</p>
<p>	  4 month forward =  9.94%	4 month forward =  9.11%</p>
<p>	  5 month forward = 10.54%	5 month forward = 10.00%</p>
<p>	  6 month forward = 10.39%	6 month forward = 10.07%</p>
<p>-- Bombay newsroom, 91-22-265 9000</p>
